                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "If you're a cool guy like me and like playing games solo, then this game is fun playing solo, switching between the four characters in solo mode, managing their mana and shared health pool, all while dodging enemies and cluttler they send out is fun, although my ultimate ability button on joystick is currently broken, this game is completly clearable without the use of ultimates or the tank character. I found the first boss to be quite difficult,  but that is only if you don't see the tutorial stage first. Aiming was a bitch and would like some sort of aiming assistance that locks on the targets. Currently there are only 4 bosses, but would like to have many more to beat, as the previous four just left me wanting for more. The only real dislike was the design of the health and mana HUD as the pixelated look didn't grow on me.",
